  "fullDescription": "Add cozy holiday charm to your Christmas decorations with this Christmas Sweater Ornament STL. The festive ornament features a bright red sweater-style body, large snowflake decoration, heart accents, white decorative details, green trim, and a holly-inspired top for a cheerful seasonal look.\n\nThe built-in hanging loop makes it perfect for Christmas tree ornaments, holiday decorations, gift tags, party favors, seasonal displays, and handmade Christmas crafts.\n\nFeatures\nCute Christmas sweater-inspired design\nLarge decorative snowflake\nHeart and winter accents\nGreen and white festive trim\nHolly-inspired top decoration\nBuilt-in hanging loop\nGreat for colorful 3D printing\nSuitable for FDM printing\nIdeal for PLA, PETG, and similar materials\nPerfect For\n\nChristmas Trees • Holiday Decor • Gift Tags • Party Favors • Christmas Gifts • Seasonal Displays • Handmade Crafts • Winter Decorations",
